Subject: [PATCH 0904/3799] soh: rename D_80A88164 -> sOfferedFishCs

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: CutsceneData script installed by EnJj_BeginCutscene, the branch that also sets EVENTCHKINF_OFFERED_FISH_TO_JABU_JABU and opens Jabu-Jabu's mouth.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Jj/z_en_jj_cutscene_data.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Jj/z_en_jj.c               | 2 +-
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Jj/z_en_jj_cutscene_data.c | 3 ++-
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Jj/z_en_jj.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Jj/z_en_jj.c
index 1b4635927..e67452438 100644
